== Notes==
* A magic staff has a minimum of three properties.
* Magic staves cannot be wielded in the [[off-hand]] without using a modified [[baseitems.2da]].
* Most staves are used by [[sorcerer]]s and [[wizard]]s.
* All standard staves start with 50 [[charge]]s.
* There are no specific weapon feats ([[Weapon focus|weapon focus]], [[Weapon specialization|weapon specialization]], [[Improved critical|improved critical]], etc.) for the magic staff.
<!-- * Magic staves are listed under the [[stave blueprint category]] of the [[item palette]] in the [[Toolset]]. -->

== Standard magic staves ==

===Staff of Command===
*Immunity: [[mind-affecting]] spells
*Cast spell: ''[[charm monster]]'' (5) 5 charges
*Cast spell: ''[[charm person]]'' (2) 2 charges
*Cast spell: ''[[dominate person]]'' (7) 5 charges

===Staff of Defense===
*Armor class bonus: +2
*Useable only by sorcerer or wizard
*Cast spell: ''[[ghostly visage]]'' (3) 2 charges
*Cast spell: ''[[mage armor]]'' (2) 1 charge
*Cast spell: ''[[protection from alignment]]'' (5) 3 charges

===Staff of Power===
*Useable only by sorcerer or wizard
*Cast spell: ''[[fireball]]'' (5) 3 charges
*Cast spell: ''[[magic missile]]'' (5) 2 charges
*Cast spell: ''[[ray of enfeeblement]]'' (2) 1 charge

===Staff of the Holy===
*Useable only by [[cleric]]s.
*Cast spell: ''[[aid]]'' (3) 2 charges
*Cast spell: ''[[cure light wounds]]'' (5) 1 charge
*Cast spell: ''[[cure moderate wounds]]'' (6) 3 charges

===Staff of the Magi===
*Enhancement bonus: +1
*Useable only by sorcerer or wizard
*On hit: [[dispel magic]] (10 by cap)
*Cast spell: ''dispel magic'' (5) 1 charge
*Cast spell: ''fireball'' (10) 2 charges
*Cast spell: ''[[ice storm]]'' (9) 2 charges
*Cast spell: ''[[invisibility]]'' (3) 1 charge
*Cast spell: ''[[light]]'' (1) 0 charges
*Cast spell: ''[[lightning bolt]]'' (10) 2 charges
*Cast spell: ''[[mage armor]]'' (2) 0 charges

===Staff of Valmaxian===
*Armor class bonus: +2
*Enhancement bonus: +3
*Usable only by sorcerer or wizard
*Cast spell: ''[[chain lightning]]'' (11) 5 charges
*Cast spell: ''[[ethereal visage]]'' (9) 5 charges
*Cast spell: ''fireball'' (5) 3 charges

===Staff of Meldanen===
*Bonus Feat: Spell Penetration
*Light Bright (20m) Red
*Cast spell: [[Melf's Acid Arrow]] (6) 5 charges
